// Batch033 copy (generated by tools/patch033.py from Batch032Screens.HC (lid sounds moved to the ChestTileEntity tick))
// Batch032 ChestScreen / FurnaceScreen (touch layout of MCPE 0.8.1) + container item helpers.
// ChestScreen: two Touch::InventoryPanes (player inventory left, chest right); tap moves one item, holding moves
// a growing share and the whole stack after (10*count+700) ms (handleRenderPane/queryHoldTime). FurnaceScreen:
// inventory pane filtered to fuels + smeltables, ingredient/fuel/result slots, flame + arrow from gui/spritesheet.png.
MCPatch029 g32_pBg,g32_pSlot,g32_pSlotSel,g32_pHi,g32_pFrame;Bool g32_patches=FALSE;
